  "sourceTitle": "Indian Punch",
  "sourceText": "Indian Punch\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, December 5, 2009 - 11:25pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 cups SUGAR\n4 cups WATER\n1 juice of 4 LEMONS\n1 cup STRONG TEA\n1 teaspoon VANILLA\n1 teaspoon ALMOND EXTRACT\n1 quart GINGER ALE, CHILLED\n\nPreparation\n\n1 COMBINE SUGAR, WATER, AND LEMON JUICE IN SAUCEPAN; PLACE OVER LOW HEAT AND BOIL 3 MINS.; COOL. STIR IN TEA AND FLAVORINGS. WHEN READY TO SERVE ADD GINGER ALE; SERVE OVER ICE.",
